    "created_at": "2022-03-23T08:29:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-03-23T08:29:37Z",
    "body": "I'm not really sure how to read that or how it makes sense if a `notes` URL were to be translated to a `https` URL, as this would allow for. https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/draft-dconmy-notes-uri-scheme also suggests in its Goals section that it's for a local application, which this would not be. Anyway, I guess it's good enough as far as IANA goes. The other things that are needed are implementer support and tests. (Please reinstate https://github.com/whatwg/html/blob/main/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md to make it easier to track that.)",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
