    "updated_at": "2022-04-14T16:57:50Z",
    "body": "At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\r\n- Chrome is [interested](https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=1300279#c6)\r\n- Firefox appears to be [interested](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1761080) based on comment from [Emilio Cobos Álvarez (:emilio)](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/user_profile?user_id=546716).  @annevk  are you the Anne referred to in that comment, and can you update the bug if so?\r\n\r\n [Tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt) are written and can be reviewed and commented upon at:\r\n https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/33331\r\n \r\n [Implementation bugs](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) are filed:\r\nChrome: https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=1300279\r\nFirefox: https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1761080\r\nSafari: https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=238276",
