    "body": "At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\r\n\r\nChrome is [interested](https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=1300279#c6)\r\nFirefox is [interested](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1761080) waiting on this spec PR to move forward\r\n\r\n[Tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt) are written and can be reviewed and commented upon at:\r\nhttps://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/33331\r\n\r\n[Implementation bugs](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) are filed:\r\nChrome: https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=1300279\r\nFirefox: https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1761080\r\nSafari: https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=238276",
